{"id": "sfmta-federal-payroll-approval", "title": "An SFMTA payroll approval put $35,854 in federal charges in question", "seconds": 45.0, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "3e9af2e4b1ae9997", "words": 125, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A San Francisco transit audit questioned the approval of payroll costs for 39 users.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.16, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "approved", "the", "time?"], "sub": "The disputed cost had a narrow scope"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The questioned payroll and indirect costs totaled $35,854.", "t0": 5.28, "t1": 10.22, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$35,854", "label": "The disputed cost had a narrow scope"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The finding concerns approval of the time recorded.", "t0": 10.34, "t1": 12.74, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "audit", "heading": "Payroll approval", "context": "FY2016 audit", "rows": [{"label": "Users", "value": "39"}, {"label": "Costs questioned", "value": "$35,854"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The transit program accounted for $9,189.", "t0": 12.96, "t1": 16.74, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,189", "label": "Two separate federal programs"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Highway planning and construction accounted for $26,665.", "t0": 16.86, "t1": 21.71, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "oig", "layout": "table", "heading": "Federal shares", "context": "San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency", "rows": [{"label": "Federal Transit", "value": "$9,189"}, {"label": "Highway Planning", "value": "$26,665"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The two figures are parts of the same original total.", "t0": 21.83, "t1": 24.39, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Two separate federal programs", "text": "One cost finding", "mark": "One"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The next audit marked the problem fully corrected in 2017.", "t0": 24.51, "t1": 27.82, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reply", "kicker": "Agency response and audit follow-up", "text": "Fully corrected", "mark": "Fully"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The federal oversight record followed its own timeline.", "t0": 27.94, "t1": 30.63, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reply", "kicker": "Agency response and audit follow-up", "text": "Federal recommendations", "mark": "Federal"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The highway recommendations closed in January 2018.", "t0": 30.85, "t1": 33.97, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closure", "kicker": "Four federal recommendations closed on different dates", "text": "Highway recommendations", "mark": "Highway"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The final transit recovery recommendation closed in September 2022.", "t0": 34.09, "t1": 38.08, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "closure", "layout": "table", "heading": "Conditional recovery closure", "context": "San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency", "rows": [{"label": "Highway", "value": "January 2018"}, {"label": "Transit", "value": "September 2022"}]}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The underlying decision would show whether the agency actually repaid money.", "t0": 38.2, "t1": 41.77, "shot": "s10"